 "Sets the speed at which the mouse pointer moves. The mouse pointer is displayed in the Internet browser and in games and other software that support use of a mouse.": "设置鼠标指针移动的速度。鼠标指针显示在互联网浏览器以及支持鼠标使用的游戏和其他软件中。",
 "Sets the text entry method for a connected keyboard.": "为连接的键盘设置文本输入方法。",
